    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions on Mean Proportional, Third Proportional, and Continued Proportion are frequently asked in tier-1 competitive exams.",
        "Pay special attention to 'Ratio When Quantities Change' and 'Division Among Three Quantities' as they carry high weightage.",
        "Expressing percentage increments (e.g., A gets 25% more than B) directly as ratios (5:4) saves critical calculation time."
      ],
