    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Ratio involves simplifying, expressing in fraction forms, finding equivalent forms, and understanding various types of ratios.",
        "Proportion concepts include the Cross Multiplication Rule, Mean Proportional, Third Proportional, and Continued Proportion.",
        "Practical ratio applications include dividing quantities among two or three parts, handling sum/difference conditions, and solving age-based problems.",
        "Percentage relationships can be directly translated into ratios to simplify competitive exam problem solving."
      ],
      "id": "euq8l06"
    },
